---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { business, generalWhatsappLink } from '../data/business';
import { featuredProducts } from '../data/catalog';
---
<section id="inicio" class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border bg-background">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-0 soft-grid opacity-70" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="page-shell relative z-10 grid items-center gap-12 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="space-y-7">
      <p class="eyebrow"><Icon name="sparkle" size={16} /> Atenção aos sinais do corpo • Cuidado 35+</p>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <h1 class="text-balance max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-5xl lg:text-[4.35rem]">
          Depois dos 35, o corpo pede mais cuidado. Encontre o suplemento para a <span class="text-primary">sua rotina</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted sm:text-xl">
          Cúrcuma, Magnésio, Ômega 3 e Colágeno para diferentes necessidades: disposição, músculos, descanso, mobilidade, alimentação e cuidado com a pele. Compare opções com atendimento humano.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap">
        <a href={generalWhatsappLink()} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button button--primary min-h-14 px-6 text-base sm:text-lg" data-cta="whatsapp-hero" data-channel="whatsapp">
          <Icon name="whatsapp" size={21} />
          Encontrar meu suplemento
        </a>
        <a href={business.instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button button--secondary min-h-14 px-6 text-base" data-cta="instagram-hero" data-channel="instagram">
          <Icon name="instagram" size={19} />
          Ver novidades no Instagram
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="max-w-xl text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
        Informe o que você procura, sua cidade ou CEP e consulte composição, disponibilidade, preço, prazo e valor da entrega antes de confirmar o pedido.
      </p>

      <div class="grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-3 border-t border-border pt-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-text"><Icon name="heart" size={19} class="text-primary" /> Para diferentes necessidades</div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-text"><Icon name="truck" size={19} class="text-primary" /> Entrega sob consulta</div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-text"><Icon name="message" size={19} class="text-primary" /> Atendimento humano</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[34rem]">
      <div class="absolute -right-5 -top-5 h-28 w-28 rounded-full bg-accent-soft blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-primary-soft blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-border bg-surface p-3 shadow-card sm:p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-border px-2 pb-4">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label">Destaques do catálogo</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-text-muted">Conheça. Consulte. Receba.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="rounded-full bg-accent-soft px-3 py-1 text-xs font-extrabold text-accent-deep">4 opções</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <figure class="relative col-span-2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-slate-50">
            <img src={featuredProducts[2].image} alt={featuredProducts[2].imageAlt} width="900" height="900" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="h-[17rem] w-full object-cover object-center sm:h-[22rem]" />
            <figcaption class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 rounded-full bg-dark/90 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-extrabold text-white">{featuredProducts[2].name}</figcaption>
          </figure>
          {featuredProducts.slice(0, 2).map((product) => (
            <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-slate-50">
              <img src={product.image} alt={product.imageAlt} width="700" height="700" loading="eager" decoding="async" class="h-36 w-full object-cover object-center sm:h-40" />
              <figcaption class="px-3 py-2 text-sm font-extrabold text-text">{product.name}</figcaption>
            </figure>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary-soft px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-primary-deep">
          <Icon name="map-pin" size={16} />
          <span>Condição de entrega conforme cidade, pedido e rota</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
